== 2. What a single slice at lay.x[0] covers (125M) ==
x blocks at [7340032, 7471104, 7602176]; z blocks at [7733248, 7864320, 7995392]; rd blocks at [8126464, 8257536, 8388608]
slice of tdb  =  131072 covers [7340032, 7471104) -> x[0] only
slice of T*d  =  393216 covers [7340032, 7733248) -> x[0..2] exactly, ends at z[0] = 7733248
slice of 2^19 =  524288 covers [7340032, 7864320) -> x[0..2] + z[0]; z[1] starts at 7864320 (NOT rd[0] = 8126464)

