== 4. Per opening, (1 - delta/3)^Q with delta = 1 - (n+Q)/nn ==
tiny endpoint 8/8: (n+Q)/nn = 0.250000 -> 2^-106.250
A,H and scaled endpoint 14/4: (n+Q)/nn = 0.253906 -> 2^-105.609
non-hiding rate 1/inv_rate at ir=4: (3/4)^256 = 2^-106.250

