-- the same, with the per-opening figure applied CONSISTENTLY --
192 existing openings (32 layers x 6) at 2^-105.609 = 2^-98.024   [D15's 2^-98.7 = 192 x 2^-106.250 = 2^-98.665]
whole proof before endpoints = 2^-94.102
whole proof after  endpoints = 2^-94.070
loss = -0.031 bits
dominant term: lookup 2^-94.2 vs commitment 2^-97.609 (ratio 0.0941)

